msgid "# Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (Qwen2.5-VL)"
msgstr "# 预填充-解码分离（Qwen2.5-VL）"

msgid "## Getting Started"
msgstr "## 快速开始"

msgid ""
"Using the Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct model as an example, use vLLM-Ascend "
"{{vllm_ascend_version}} (with vLLM {{vllm_version}}) on 1 Atlas 800T A2 "
"server to deploy the \"1P1D\" architecture (one Prefiller and one Decoder on"
" the same node). Assume the IP address is 192.0.0.1."
msgstr ""
"以 Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct 模型为例，在 1 台 Atlas 800T A2 服务器上使用 vLLM-Ascend "
"{{vllm_ascend_version}}（搭配 vLLM "
"{{vllm_version}}）部署“1P1D”架构（同一节点上一个预填充器和一个解码器）。假设 IP 地址为 192.0.0.1。"

msgid "## Verify Communication Environment"
msgstr "## 验证通信环境"

msgid "### Verification Process"
msgstr "### 验证流程"

msgid "1. Single Node Verification:"
msgstr "1. 单节点验证："

msgid ""
"Execute the following commands in sequence. The results must all be "
"`success` and the status must be `UP`:"
msgstr "依次执行以下命令。结果必须全部为 `success`，且状态必须为 `UP`："

msgid "2. Check NPU HCCN Configuration:"
msgstr "2. 检查 NPU HCCN 配置："

msgid ""
"Ensure that the hccn.conf file exists in the environment. If using Docker, "
"mount it into the container."
msgstr "确保环境中存在 hccn.conf 文件。如果使用 Docker，请将其挂载到容器中。"

msgid "3. Get NPU IP Addresses"
msgstr "3. 获取 NPU IP 地址"

msgid "5. Check NPU TLS Configuration"
msgstr "5. 检查 NPU TLS 配置"

msgid "## Run with Docker"
msgstr "## 使用 Docker 运行"

msgid "## Install Mooncake"
msgstr "## 安装 Mooncake"

msgid ""
"Mooncake is the serving platform for Kimi, a leading LLM service provided by Moonshot AI. Installation and Compilation Guide: <https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake?tab=readme-ov-file#build-and-use-binaries>.\n"
"First, we need to obtain the Mooncake project. Refer to the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Mooncake 是 Kimi（Moonshot AI 提供的领先 LLM 服务）的服务平台。安装与编译指南：<https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake?tab=readme-ov-file#build-and-use-binaries>。\n"
"首先，我们需要获取 Mooncake 项目。请参考以下命令："

msgid ""
"Install the relevant dependencies. The installation of Go is not required."
msgstr "安装相关依赖。无需安装 Go。"

msgid "Compile and install."
msgstr "编译并安装。"

msgid "Set environment variables."
msgstr "设置环境变量。"

msgid "**Note:**"
msgstr "**注意：**"

msgid ""
"- Adjust the Python path according to your specific Python installation\n"
"- Ensure `/usr/local/lib` and `/usr/local/lib64` are in your `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`"
msgstr ""
"- 根据您的具体 Python 安装调整 Python 路径\n"
"- 确保 `/usr/local/lib` 和 `/usr/local/lib64` 位于您的 `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 中"

msgid "## Prefiller/Decoder Deployment"
msgstr "## 预填充器/解码器部署"

msgid ""
"We can run the following scripts to launch a server on the prefiller/decoder"
" NPU, respectively."
msgstr "我们可以运行以下脚本，分别在预填充器/解码器 NPU 上启动服务器。"

msgid "=== \"Prefiller\""
msgstr "=== \"预填充器\""

msgid "=== \"Decoder\""
msgstr "=== \"解码器\""

msgid "## Example Proxy for Deployment"
msgstr "## 部署示例代理"

msgid ""
"Run a proxy server on the same node with the prefiller service instance. You"
" can get the proxy program in the repository's examples: "
"[load\\_balance\\_proxy\\_server\\_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)"
msgstr ""
"在与预填充器服务实例相同的节点上运行代理服务器。您可以在仓库的示例中获取代理程序：[load\\_balance\\_proxy\\_server\\_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)"

msgid "## Verification"
msgstr "## 验证"

msgid "Check service health using the proxy server endpoint."
msgstr "使用代理服务器端点检查服务健康状态。"

msgid "|Parameter  | Meaning |"
msgstr "|参数 | 含义 |"

msgid ""
"vLLM-Ascend now supports prefill-decode (PD) disaggregation. This guide "
"provides step-by-step instructions to verify this feature in resource-"
"constrained environments."
msgstr "vLLM-Ascend 现已支持预填充-解码（PD）分离。本指南提供在资源受限环境中验证此功能的分步说明。"

msgid "(Optional) Replace go install URL if the network is poor."
msgstr "（可选）如果网络状况不佳，请替换 go install 的 URL。"

msgid "Install MPI."
msgstr "安装 MPI。"

msgid ""
"If you want to run \"2P1D\" (two Prefiller and one Decoder), please set "
"ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES and port to different values for each P process."
msgstr ""
"如果您想运行“2P1D”（两个预填充进程和一个解码进程），请为每个 P 进程设置不同的 ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES 和端口值。"

msgid "| --port | Proxy port |"
msgstr "| --port | 代理端口 |"

msgid "| --decoder-ports | All decoder ports |"
msgstr "| --decoder-ports | 所有解码端口 |"

msgid ""
"For P/D transfer priority settings, see [QoS "
"Configuration](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#qos-configuration)."
msgstr ""
"关于 P/D 传输优先级设置，请参阅 [QoS 配置](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#qos-"
"configuration)。"

msgid "!!! note \"Timeout for long sequences or high concurrency\""
msgstr "!!! note \"长序列或高并发场景下的超时设置\""

msgid ""
"Increasing this timeout generally does not affect inference accuracy or "
"performance during normal operation. If a decoder (D) node fails while "
"requests still have KV caches on the prefiller (P) node that the decoder has"
" not received, a longer timeout delays releasing those caches. They continue"
" to occupy HBM, reducing the memory available for other requests on the P "
"node until they are released."
msgstr ""
"调大该超时通常不会影响正常运行时的推理精度或性能。如果 decoder（D）节点发生故障，而此时请求的 KV cache 仍留在 "
"prefiller（P）节点上且 decoder 尚未接收，那么更长的超时会延迟这些 cache 的释放。在释放之前，它们会持续占用 HBM，从而减少 "
"P 节点上可供其他请求使用的内存。"

msgid ""
"For disjoint P/D device assignments and the interaction between\n"
"`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` and `--device-ids`, see\n"
"[NPU Device Selection](../../user_guide/configuration/device_selection.md#prefill-decode-disaggregation)."
msgstr ""
"关于 P/D 设备分离分配以及 `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` 与 `--device-ids` 之间的交互，请参阅\n"
"[NPU 设备选择](../../user_guide/configuration/device_selection.md#prefill-decode-disaggregation)。"

msgid "4. (Optional) Cross-Node PING Test (skip for single-node deployment)"
msgstr "4. （可选）跨节点 PING 测试（单节点部署可跳过）"

msgid ""
"Start a Docker container. The command needs [Ascend Docker "
"Runtime](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-ascend-docker-"
"runtime) on the host and selects the NPUs with `ASCEND_VISIBLE_DEVICES`."
msgstr ""
"启动 Docker 容器。该命令要求宿主机上安装 [Ascend Docker "
"Runtime](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-ascend-docker-"
"runtime)，并使用 `ASCEND_VISIBLE_DEVICES` 选择 NPU。"

msgid ""
"The fixed timeout below applies to `MooncakeConnectorV1`. For\n"
"    `MooncakeConnectorV2`, configure `kv_lease_duration` instead; see\n"
"    [MooncakeConnectorV2 KV Leases](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#mooncakeconnectorv2-kv-leases)."
msgstr ""
"下面的固定超时适用于 `MooncakeConnectorV1`。对于\n"
"    `MooncakeConnectorV2`，请改为配置 `kv_lease_duration`；参见\n"
"    [MooncakeConnectorV2 KV 租约](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#mooncakeconnectorv2-kv-leases)。"

msgid ""
"For long sequences or high concurrency, the default KV-cache release timeout"
" of 480 seconds may be insufficient. Increase it as needed by setting "
"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT` in the prefiller startup script:"
msgstr ""
"对于长序列或高并发场景，默认的 480 秒 KV 缓存释放超时可能不够。可根据需要，在 prefiller 启动脚本中设置 "
"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT` 来延长超时："

msgid "The value is in seconds: `1800` allows 30 minutes before timeout."
msgstr "该值单位为秒：`1800` 表示超时前可等待 30 分钟。"

msgid "| --prefiller-ports | All prefiller ports |"
msgstr "| --prefiller-ports | 所有 prefiller 端口 |"

msgid "### Decode health probes without a prefill service"
msgstr "### 不依赖 prefill 服务的 Decode 健康探测"

msgid ""
"With `MooncakeConnectorV2`, send a request directly to D with\n"
"`do_virtual: true` and `do_remote_prefill: true` in `kv_transfer_params` to\n"
"exercise D-side scheduling and inference without transferring KV cache from P.\n"
"This works in both default pull mode and layerwise push mode\n"
"(`kv_connector_extra_config.use_layerwise=true`). The flag defaults to false."
msgstr ""
"使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 时，可直接向 D 发送请求，在 `kv_transfer_params` 中设置\n"
"`do_virtual: true` 和 `do_remote_prefill: true`，从而在不从 P 传输 KV 缓存的情况下\n"
"验证 D 侧的调度和推理。该方式适用于默认的 pull 模式和 layerwise push 模式\n"
"（`kv_connector_extra_config.use_layerwise=true`）。该标志默认为 false。"

msgid ""
"For pull mode, retain the required remote metadata fields as placeholders, "
"for example:"
msgstr "对于 pull 模式，请保留所需的远端元数据字段作为占位符，例如："

msgid ""
"Set `remote_num_prompt_tokens` to the actual prompt token count and use the\n"
"appropriate number of KV cache groups. For layerwise push probes, only\n"
"`do_remote_prefill` and `do_virtual` are needed in `kv_transfer_params`; D does\n"
"not dispatch the request to P through the metaserver. Use a short nonempty prompt,\n"
"disable prefix caching for this check, and request only a small number of output tokens."
msgstr ""
"将 `remote_num_prompt_tokens` 设置为实际的 prompt token 数，并使用\n"
"合适数量的 KV 缓存组。对于 layerwise push 探测，`kv_transfer_params` 中只需\n"
"`do_remote_prefill` 和 `do_virtual`；D 不会\n"
"通过 metaserver 将请求分发到 P。请使用简短且非空的 prompt，\n"
"为此检查禁用前缀缓存，并且仅请求少量输出 token。"

msgid ""
"A successful probe confirms request completion on D. Generated text is not an\n"
"accuracy result because historical KV cache was not transferred."
msgstr ""
"探测成功可确认请求在 D 上完成。由于未传输历史 KV 缓存，\n"
"生成的文本并不代表精度结果。"

msgid "### Normal PD inference"
msgstr "### 常规 PD 推理"
